## check: 020_read_forces_axes.dat -a1e-4
## labels: quick regression

## Urea: READ_FORCES from the AXES dataset of the index-2 supercell (30
## displaced structures, +-a, +-b, +-c of the supercell for each of the
## 5 independent atoms). The FHI-aims outputs are synthetic, with the
## harmonic forces F = -Phi u of urea_fc2_sym.dat (see
## zz_source/critic2/vibrations-urea/README), so the frequencies must be
## those of 016_read_forces_fd (phonopy's directions, 24 structures):
## they agree to 2e-5 cm^-1. The tolerance is 1e-4 cm^-1 for the
## acoustic zeros at gamma, as in 016.
crystal ../zz_source/critic2/vibrations-urea/urea.in
vibrations
  calculator aims
  read_forces ../zz_source/critic2/vibrations-urea/fd_axes/disp-*/aims.out dataset ../zz_source/critic2/vibrations-urea/fd_axes/disp.txt
  calcq file 020_read_forces_axes.dat
    q 0 0 0
    q 0.1 0.2 0.3
    q 0.5 0.0 0.5
    q 0.37 -0.21 0.05
  endcalcq
end
